  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rysk och baltisk konferensmedverkan i &quot;Electronic Publishing 499&quot; . Konferensen organiseras av &#xd6;stersj&#xf6;institutet i samarbete med H&#xf6;gskolan i Karlskrona/Soft Center i Ronneby 10-12 maj 1999. Kostnadsbidrag p&#xe5; max 9000 SEK per person f&#xf6;r 10 &#xf6;steuropeiska deltagare f&#xf6;r resa och uppeh&#xe4;lle.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The conference &quot;Electronic Publishing 499&quot; will be held in Ronneby 10-12 maj 1999, and is organized by The Baltic Sea Institute (&#xd6;stersj&#xf6;institutet), Soft Center and the College of Karlskrona. Sida will cover travel and living costs for 10 conference participants from eastern Europe of a maximum of 9000 SEK per person.</narrative>
  </description>
